Emissions Banking and Trading Program
*Level of Activity Certification Update* 
The Emissions Banking and Trading team is currently in the process of reviewing about 300 Form ECT-3, Level of Activity Certifications that have been submitted thus far. Due to the overwhelming workload, the review process will last for the remainder of the year. If you have submitted a Form ECT-3, a team member will contact you, should the need arise for additional supporting information. Thank you for your cooperation. 


