MINETA SAYS UNITED-USAIR DEAL DOUBTFUL BUT FORESEES OTHER
CONSOLIDATION EFFORTS
A year after they announced a multi-billion dollar deal to
combine their operations and create the world's largest
carrier, United Airlines and US Airways now appear unlikely
to be able to consummate their merger, Transportation
Secretary Norman Mineta said June 5.

