ACQUISITION OF HIDROCANTA`BRICO
The European Commission on June 5 decided to undertake a
full, second phase investigation of the proposed acquisition
of joint control over the Spanish utility Hidroele`ctrica
del Canta`brico S.A. by the Spanish Group Villar Mir and the
German Energie Baden-Wu`rttemberg.

