A Massachusetts statute regulating business practices
between motor vehicle manufactures, distributors, and
dealers is inapplicable to a dealership for lawn care and
ground maintenance equipment made by Deere & Co., according
to a decision by the Massachusetts Supreme Judicial Court
("Deere & Co. v. Ford, "Mass. Sup. Jud. Ct., SJC-08426,
5/23/01).

