STATUTORY FRAUD IS NOT SUBJECT TO HEIGHTENED PLEADING
STANDARD
Statutory fraud need not be pleaded with particularity in
Delaware, according to a decision by the Delaware Court of
Chancery, New Castle County ("Delaware v. Publishers
Clearing House, "Del. Ct. Chan., New Castle Cty., C.A. No.
17756, 4/19/01).

