going on in the neighborhood around us.
 
I felt it my duty to alert the association about an ATTEMPTED break in
that occurred at our home.  We have an attached storage room in the back
of our home, with a separate entrance.  It has old paint, some wood, a cat
carrier and a few items of NO value!!  It seems a few night ago someone,
armed with a cordless drill, and obviously nothing better to do, tried to
no avail to drill all the way through the door and break the lock to get
