2.	Earnings Releases

Earnings season will slow down next week with approximately
870 companies scheduled to report next week.  Dominating the
headlines will be the insurance sector with Chubb {CB},
Cigna {CI}, Hartford Financial Services {HIG}, and John
Hancock Financial Services {JHF} all reporting quarterly
results.

