quityAlert.com.     Yahoo! Launches Yahoo! Essentials - Giving Users the Po=
wer to ``Yahoo!-ize'' Their Desktop Environments=1DYahoo! Essentials provid=
es consumers with the best of Yahoo! in one easy to download application; C=
ompaq delivers Yahoo! Essentials directly to consumers   SUNNYVALE, Calif.,=
 Oct 23, 2001 (BUSINESS WIRE) -- Yahoo! Inc. (Nasdaq:YHOO), a leading globa=
l Internet communications, commerce and media company, today announced the =
launch of Yahoo! Essentials (http://essentials.yahoo.com/), an easy-to-down=
load application that customizes consumers' desktop environments by install=
ing Yahoo!'s most popular products and services on their Windows operating =
system. Yahoo! Essentials puts the best of Yahoo! at consumers' fingertips =
by giving them the option to integrate popular services such as Yahoo!(R)Me=
ssenger, Mail, Briefcase, Photos, Games, My Yahoo!, Search and Companion in=
to their desktop environment.   Available with one easy download from http:=
//essentials.yahoo.com/, Yahoo! Essentials installs multiple Yahoo! service=
s in a single registration and installation process. Yahoo! Essentials make=
s it easy for consumers to customize their Internet Explorer browsers and d=
esktop operating systems, providing convenient access to the powerful Yahoo=
! network that has earned the loyalty of more than 210 million unique users=
 and 80 million active registered users.   "Yahoo! Essentials expands upon =
Yahoo!'s tradition of offering products and services that are an integral p=
art of consumers' lives," said Henry Sohn, vice president and general manag=
er network services, Yahoo! Inc. "In response to user demand, we are offeri=
ng consumers the opportunity to download Yahoo! Essentials to make it even =
easier for them to access personalized Yahoo! content and services. Our all=
iance with Compaq Computer also provides Yahoo! with added distribution pow=
er and puts Yahoo! Essentials directly into the hands of thousands of new c=
omputer purchasers."   Yahoo! Essentials on Compaq Computer  Yahoo! has exp=
anded its existing alliance with leading computer manufacturer Compaq Compu=
ter, and distribution of Yahoo! Essentials is anticipated for early 2002. O=
nce distribution begins, new Presario Internet personal computers and noteb=
ooks purchased either online or at retail stores will have a preloaded Yaho=
o! Essentials desktop icon.   "Compaq is committed to providing our custome=
rs with the ability to easily enhance their PC and Internet experiences," s=
aid Kevin Kyle, Director and General Manager of Internet Services and e-com=
merce at Compaq. "Yahoo! Essentials delivers upon this commitment by offeri=
ng popular Internet tools at the click of a button."   How Yahoo! Essential=
s Works  Yahoo! Essentials is a complete solution that integrates Yahoo! pr=
oducts and services throughout consumers' operating systems, giving new use=
rs an easy means to access the best of the Web and existing users a shortcu=
t to their personalized Yahoo! content and services.   Yahoo! Essentials is=
 a complementary tool to Microsoft Windows operating systems that takes up =
