quityAlert.com.     Website Pros Announces Agreement with Yahoo! Store; Web=
site Pros' Full-Service E-Commerce Web Design Services Now Available to Yah=
oo! Store Merchants   JACKSONVILLE, Fla., Oct 23, 2001 (BUSINESS WIRE) -- W=
ebsite Pros (http://www.websitepros.com), a premier provider of full-servic=
e Web site and commerce solutions to small and medium-sized businesses, tod=
ay announced an agreement with Yahoo! Inc. (Nasdaq:YHOO), a leading global =
Internet communications, commerce and media company, to provide merchants o=
n Yahoo!(R) Store (http://store.yahoo.com) with Website Pros' custom Web de=
sign and support services.   Through the agreement, Yahoo! Store merchants =
interested in outsourcing Web design for their Yahoo! Store will have the o=
pportunity to cost-effectively work with Website Pros to design their store=
.   "It is our mission to help companies like Yahoo! build stronger, more p=
rofitable relationships with their small business customers," said Darin Br=
annan, senior vice president and founder of Website Pros, Inc. "We are thri=
lled to work with Yahoo! to provide the highest quality site design, custom=
er service, and technology to merchants using the Yahoo! Store platform."  =
 Website Pros has helped more than 40,000 small businesses build profession=
al quality Web sites, and recently won Call Center of the Year award from C=
all Center Magazine for its world-class customer support capabilities. Webs=
ite Pros offers a range of solutions - including the NetObjects technology =
platform, small business Web site design services, and private-label custom=
er support - to nearly 30 companies delivering Web service programs to thei=
r small business customers.   "We are pleased to be working with Website Pr=
os to offer their full-service Web design and support services to Yahoo! St=
ore merchants," said Sara Hicks, producer, Yahoo! Store. "The addition of W=
ebsite Pros' services complements the existing services offered, giving mer=
chants a greater ability to successfully build and operate a Yahoo! Store."=
   Website Pros is offering hands-on support to small businesses throughout=
 the entire Web site design process. Customers' needs are determined throug=
h an interview process and the site will be designed to meet the individual=
 needs of each customer and their business. Each Web site will be custom de=
signed including look-and-feel, copywriting and professional editing. Each =
Web site goes through an extensive quality control process prior to publica=
tion on the Web.   Yahoo! Small Business (http://smallbusiness.yahoo.com) o=
ffers a suite of resources and solutions to enable small businesses to esta=
blish and grow a business presence on the Web. Yahoo! Small Business offers=
 essential solutions and services to allow small businesses to get online, =
sell online and develop effective online marketing and promotional strategi=
es. In addition, Yahoo! Small Business provides relevant resources such as =
business planning content and tools, office supply shopping and mailroom re=
sources, as well as pertinent news and information - all of which help smal=
l businesses grow business and manage daily operations.   About Website Pro=
s  Website Pros helps large companies build stronger, more profitable custo=
mer relationships with their small business customers. The company offers a=
 comprehensive suite of Web site design, customer support, and technology s=
olutions tailored to the needs of the small business community. The company=
's National Design Center -- which employs more than 150 Web site designers=
, artists, and copywriters -- won Call Center Magazine's Call Center of the=
 Year in 2000 for excellence in customer service and technology.   Based in=
 Jacksonville, Florida, Website Pros, Inc., is privately held and is funded=
 by Norwest Venture Partners, Crosspoint Venture Partners, Pivotal Asset Ma=
nagement, Chase Capital Partners, Verizon, PurchasePro.com, Office Depot, a=
nd Dell. Website Pros can be reached by calling 888-372-7586 or on the Inte=
rnet at http://www.websitepros.com.   Yahoo! and the Yahoo! logo are tradem=
arks and/or registered trademarks of Yahoo! Inc.   All other names are trad=
emarks and/or registered trademarks of their respective owners   CONTACT:  =
