Industry Group Analysis

This Week: Big Chart Update for the Week of October 22

1.	Introduction
2.	Groups That Are Heating Up
3.	Groups That Are Cooling Off
4.	On The Radar Screen This Week
5.	Disclaimer

***********************Our Sponsor*************************
Are you making money shorting stocks? You should be. Learn how
to profit in a recession. Hot Stix shows you all the ropes of shorting,
