          <TD width="100%" bgColor=f2f2e6><B>Dear Stockscape Review
            Subscriber,</B>
            <P><I>It is a pleasure to bring you up to date on the outstanding
            performance of our last 3 Featured Companies. Since introducing you
            to Energy Power Systems (OTC/BB: EYPSF), Pacific Magtron
            International Corp. (NASDAQ: PMIC), and Cetalon Corporation (OTC/BB:
