 <font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1"> Dear Andrew,
 <p>We at iConnectHere would like to express our deepest sympathy to
 our customers and to those affected by the tragedies in the United
 States last month. Despite what has happened, we are focused and
 committed to our customers and will continue growing strong as we
 get through this difficult time. If you would like to help support
 relief efforts of the American Red Cross, please <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=001iconherh1017708c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">click
 here</a>.</p>
 <p><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>We've Done It Again? Rate
 Reduction</b></font><br>
 Use your iConnectHere account as a Calling Card and save up to 20%
 worldwide. Call the US for as low as 5.9 cents! We're always looking
 for ways to help you save?<a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=002iconherh1017709c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">click
 here</a> to see our new low rates. </p>
 <p><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1"><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>Take
 our survey</b></font><br>
 As we continue to improve our products and features, we would like
 your thoughts, please tell us what you think. <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=003iconherh1017716c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">Click
 here</a> to take the survey. Your opinions are important to us.</font></font></p>
 <p><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>FREE Offer</b></font><br>
 Refill your iConnectHere account at anytime and receive $5 FREE
 with every charge of $50 or more. Don't miss out. <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=004iconherh1017717c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">Click
 here</a> to take advantage of this special offer.</p>
 <font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>Payphone Surcharge</b></font><br>
 <font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1">When calling from
 payphones in the US, you must now dial 877-449-5782. Due to FCC regulations,
 all Calling Card calls from payphones in the US will incur a $0.30
 surcharge. Remember, this new number is NOT to be used for regular
 telephone calls, as you will incur unwanted charges. We apologize
 for this inconvenience.
 <p><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>Shop-n-Talk</b></font><br>
 Improve your PC-to-Phone sound quality with an Internet handset
 or headset. This month, save 30% on the SC-RIPHAND Internet Handset
 and check out our new Digital Stereo Headset. <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=005iconherh1017712c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">Start
 shopping</a>.</p>
 <p><font size="2"><b><font color="#FF0000">Get Your Own Number</font></b></font><br>
 V2Phone recently won an innovation award from TMS, a leading communications
 magazine. We are launching a new version of this Broadband phone
 in a about a month with exciting new features. <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=006iconherh1017713c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">Click
 here</a> to learn more about V2Phone.</p>
 <p><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>Calling All Affiliates</b></font><br>
 The Voice Partner Program needs recruits. Open up a revenue stream
 on your website with no setup costs and no maintenance. Earn up
 to 30% commissions quickly and easily! <a href="http://www.m-ul.com/o/c.cgi?o=007iconherh1017714c&e=alewis@ect.enron.com">Click
 here</a> for more information.</p>
 <p><font size="2" color="#FF0000"><b>We Want YOU to Become Our Reseller
 </b> </font><br>
 Find your inner entrepreneur. Sign up for the deltathree Reseller
 program and unleash your money making potential. You can start by
 emailing <a href="mailto:deltathreeReseller@deltathree.com">deltathreeReseller@deltathree.com</a>
 and receive additional discount points off your order just for taking
 the first step. </p>
 <p>As always, thank you for choosing iConnectHere. </p>
 <p><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1">Sincerely,<br>
 <br>
 The iConnectHere Team</font><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="1"><br>
