L. Murphy, vice president of human resources at Ford Motor Co.; Anne Szosta=
k, executive vice president and director of human resources and diversity a=
t FleetBoston Financial Corp.; and Francesca M. Spinelli, senior vice presi=
dent of people at RadioShack Corp.   Winners were recognized on Oct. 17 dur=
