------------------------------------------------------------
Rel Performance 6-Wk          Between 110.0 - 99998.0, High
Rel Performance 1-Day         Between 10.0 - 98.0, Low
Acc. Dist 1-Wk Chg            Between -999.0 - -1.0
Volume 30-Day Average         Between 250.0 - 99998.0

