ISN Ones to Watch 1/22/2002: Return From South Beach
_______________________________________________________________
TABLE OF CONTENTS

1. Overall Sentiment
2. Observations
3. Weekly Portfolio Results
4. Sonny T's System Picks
5. From the Readers
6. Trading Methods & Strategies
