EMC Corp. (EMC) - 15.2%
Juniper Networks (JNPR) - 18%
Sun Microsystems (SUNW) - 18.8%
AOL Time-Warner (AOL) - 0.15%
Check Point Software (CHKP) - 10%
Efunds (EFDS) - 7.5%
Comverse Technology (CMVT) - 5.48%

