Key Technical Developments (close of 06/06)
-------------------------------------------------------
The June British pound closed decisively below the 20-year low at
139.06. I have a short term target at 137.05, with my long term target
remaining at 125! Could be the move of the year!

December Euro's are beginning to gain on September as they registered
a new contract high close. Another 10-15 point rally is expected near
term.

Action in the beans looks very constructive. The seasonal should
continue to exert itself into the week ending before July 4th.

