g the press conference presenting the winners of these awards, we continue =
to deliver the best of Latin music to music aficionados throughout the U.S.=
, Latin America and around the world."   Through Yahoo!'s extensive global =
network, music fans worldwide have had VIP access to the 2001 Latin GRAMMY =
Awards participants, complete with nominee video clips, video clips of spec=
ial moments at last year's Latin GRAMMY Award Show and celebrity chats.   T=
he Latin Recording Academy is a membership-based business organization comp=
osed of musicians, producers and other creative and technical recording pro=
fessionals who are dedicated to improving the quality of life and cultural =
condition for Latin music and its makers. In addition to producing the Lati=
n GRAMMY Awards to honor excellence in the recording arts and sciences, the=
 Latin Recording Academy provides educational and human services programs i=
