125mn in investments.


ARGENTINA: OFFICIAL DEFENDS YACYRETA EXPANSION
La Nacion (Argentina), 26 Feb 2000, p. 2/7:-
 Nicolas Gallo, the Argentine Minister of Infrastructure, defended the=20
